# Building an extractor spends a labor, a metal and one of the deposit's free capacity.
#
# **The extractor is not a residency.** It stands in a relation of its own, because an extractor
# for food and an extractor for metal are different things standing in the same place - and what
# tells them apart is a column rather than a category.

{test name:an-extractor-is-built-from-labor-and-metal}

{given}
{territory id:1}
{free where:1 what:5 quantity:1}
{residency what:2 where:1 quantity:1}
{residency what:3 where:1 quantity:1}

{when}
{build-extractor where:1 for:5}

{then}
{territory id:1}
{extractor where:1 for:5 quantity:1}
